{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Murder isn't for the weak. But it is for the deranged.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A writer? Pfft, as if. What if you had joined the Slaughterhouse chatroom as an honest-to-god serial killer? Will our beloved serials be your newfound family? Or will you make sure they\u2019ll never be found again? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a serial killer in this DLC to <i>Killer Chat! Expanded Edition</i>.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your life in<i> Killer Chat!</i> in a more<i> murderous\u00a0</i>kind of way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murder your victims, kiss your serial killer beau... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... or murder them too, who's to say you <i>aren't</i> that deranged?\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's honestly up to you, dear Tragedist...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866420?t=1755039032","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866420?t=1755039032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866420/b33b105f415f00df07f36e00934402579c248935/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755039032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866420/b33b105f415f00df07f36e00934402579c248935/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755039032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Murder isn't for the weak. But it is for the deranged.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A writer? Pfft, as if. What if you had joined the Slaughterhouse chatroom as an honest-to-god seri